 "lyrics": [
  {
   "start": 14.6,
   "end": 17.6,
   "text": "Tears are like diamonds in my eye"
  },
  {
   "start": 18.0,
   "end": 21.0,
   "text": "Blinded so now you're out of sight"
  },
  {
   "start": 21.4,
   "end": 26.2,
   "text": "It's enough, it's too late to break this silence"
  },
  {
   "start": 28.2,
   "end": 31.4,
   "text": "In a rose colored view of us"
  },
  {
   "start": 31.7,
   "end": 34.8,
   "text": "I got lost, could I realize"
  },
  {
   "start": 35.1,
   "end": 38.2,
   "text": "All your lies would be blades and knives"
  },
  {
   "start": 38.8,
   "end": 40.2,
   "text": "Just stab me inside"
  },
  {
   "start": 40.6,
   "end": 43.8,
   "text": "Who will save you from this dark"
  },
  {
   "start": 44.1,
   "end": 47.2,
   "text": "Who will fix your selfish heart"
  },
  {
   "start": 47.3,
   "end": 50.4,
   "text": "A one way street, that's how you live"
  },
  {
   "start": 50.7,
   "end": 53.6,
   "text": "Why do you always take and never give"
  },
  {
   "start": 83.0,
   "end": 86.0,
   "text": "Wide awake, yeah I've crossed the line"
  },
  {
   "start": 86.3,
   "end": 89.4,
   "text": "I'm coming home, I'm running back to real life"
  },
  {
   "start": 89.9,
   "end": 94.6,
   "text": "To the start where I could breathe in freely, baby"
  },
  {
   "start": 95.6,
   "end": 99.2,
   "text": "Can't you see we run off time, chasing happiness"
  },
  {
   "start": 99.3,
   "end": 101.8,
   "text": "While you get what you need"
  },
  {
   "start": 102.7,
   "end": 106.1,
   "text": "There's nothing left of us but bleeding blades and knives"
  },
  {
   "start": 106.1,
   "end": 108.8,
   "text": "Tonight you'll know how it feels"
  },
  {
   "start": 109.0,
   "end": 112.2,
   "text": "A one way street, that's how you live"
  },
  {
   "start": 112.4,
   "end": 115.6,
   "text": "Why do you always take and never give"
  },
  {
   "start": 115.8,
   "end": 118.9,
   "text": "I walk away to help you see"
  },
  {
   "start": 119.2,
   "end": 122.4,
   "text": "Our love is rolling down so easily"
  },
  {
   "start": 122.6,
   "end": 124.4,
   "text": "A one way street"
  },
  {
   "start": 155.0,
   "end": 157.8,
   "text": "A one way street"
  },
  {
   "start": 158.4,
   "end": 161.2,
   "text": "You never give"
  },
  {
   "start": 161.8,
   "end": 164.6,
   "text": "I walk away"
  },
  {
   "start": 165.2,
   "end": 167.8,
   "text": "So easily"
  },
  {
